{"id":38,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium."},{"games":["Shield","Y","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It is said to live 1,000 years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"According to an enduring legend, nine noble saints were united and reincarnated as this Pokémon."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"The flickering flames it spews from its mouth leave its opponents hypnotized. Then, this extremely intelligent Pokémon attacks."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It is vindictive and relentless by nature. Those who cross it even once will be cursed for a thousand years, along with their descendants."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Said to live for a thousand years, this Pokémon uses its supernatural abilities to manipulate fire. It can burn its prey to a crisp as it pleases."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Legend has it that this mystical Pokémon was formed when nine saints coalesced into one."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Legend has it that Ninetales came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This Pokémon is highly intelligent—it can understand human speech."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Ninetales casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe’s mind. This Pokémon is said to live for a thousand years."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":